<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<div class="row justify-content-center py-5">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-10 col-lg-8">
        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white">
            <span class="badge bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary rounded-pill px-3 py-1 mb-3 align-self-start">Privacy Policy</span>
            <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Your Privacy is Protected</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                At Wanderlust, we value and respect your privacy. This policy outlines how we handle your personal information when you use our website, services, and accommodation booking systems.
            </p>
            <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small">
                We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, profile avatar, booking requests, and reviews. When you log in with Google OAuth, we receive verified email and profile identifiers from Google.
            </p>
            <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Information</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small">
                Your data is used solely to facilitate accommodation bookings, cab reservations, identity verification, listing management, and reviews. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
            </p>
            <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Security & Sessions</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small">
                We protect your login sessions using encrypted Express sessions stored securely in MongoDB with HTTP-only cookies and robust Passport authentication.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4 border-top mt-4">
                <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4">Back to Home</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
